	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "ntZ8wRJ7chAQqW1Rj",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 11, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 11, HP 11, WILL 10, PER 11, FP 11, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 0. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nBMo7aKtR6bFHJsQm",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 15 (offense 13, protection 2), threat tier minor, appearing 6."
		},
		{
			"id": "n-pox6wxoQ6elOvei",
			"text": "Thrown Spear: Thrown Spear (12): 1d impaling, Reach Ranged, 15. Thrown through water at short range, where a bow would be useless."
		},
		{
			"id": "ntbSQYuWqC2yvk0oy",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/merfolk.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nke2r2bAUoL8cMakW",
			"text": "Independent build total: 73 points of racial traits plus 14 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n_8_RwOxNZs72XM1c",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Merfolk (SRD 5.1); Merfolk (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbfXyXSJniXu7VY_a",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n5tStIn0TeyhvdP47",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 90 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nDso3xvCa-JxvH-VR",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5; water Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "na6mTm89VoZg5jA8b",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nufKMNDtkde7LLAUA",
			"text": "About 2.1 m nose to tail-tip, which reads on the SM 0 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nU7xKjWdVsyImMHWH",
			"text": "ST 11: a swimmer's build, strong through the back and shoulders and no use at all for carrying anything up a beach."
		},
		{
			"id": "n13sUl94zVrzdrbVY",
			"text": "Breathing is built as Doesn't Breathe with the published Oxygen Absorption limitation rather than as Gills. Gills would say a merfolk suffocates in air, and the whole encounter value of the creature is that it does not."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbULXGC74ue1Uw7IE",
			"text": "No Legs (Aquatic) prices at zero, as it does for the fish in the aquatic batch. The ground Move the movement note reports is the builder's floor, not a walk: out of water a merfolk hauls itself along at a fraction of it and should be run that way."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxO7z0KvG7ddbO5gF",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
